9043071", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393469_1190652052376404_1120160810545173723_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=14CXt6Ccbw0Q7kNvwGAh-ik&_nc_oc=Ado_MrtCOM5D4mwJppWX-2Xu0ha0MUFUtqNbTkox6-YuwfN77vt0bq9iEEg7hp-ass4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLopWp_j7kZBkqbndRWh9-B4gCsnAfb9MZ4TWvD-9i53Q&oe=6AB67C19"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover-image-1.png", "id": "1862092871277301", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295974_1862092874610634_6800276154742057243_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P5gjbng8SRwQ7kNvwGzQR-C&_nc_oc=AdpKHDU_jdJWss5QWyZk4GU1dfWI6sC2A5XTBYFdyKnHBhymncxLOwZ3gvxB5GCcfNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI0DU2f5t1j919Utw4KIKrVvYAidCF9ZEP1IL8uZrjIXQ&oe=6AB69883"}, "display_name": "XBOX", "keywords": ["Xbox", "Cloud", "CloudGaming", "GamePass", "XboxGamePass"], "long_description": "# Stream XBOX games directly on your Meta Quest     \n\nStream up to hundreds of games* like Halo Infinite, Forza Motorsport and Starfield on a massive 2D virtual display in Meta Quest with XBOX Game Pass via cloud gaming. You can also play select games installed on your console via Remote Play.\n\nAccess a library of 50+ games with a starter edition of XBOX Game Pass with Meta Horizon+** and use your go-to gaming controller to play your favorite games. \n\n{2584358135367813}\n\n# Customize your screen\n\nAdjust the screen to fit your space and comfort level, from a big screen TV to an expansive display for epic battles.\n\n{2102061437342173}\n\n# Progress goes with you\n\nStart a game on your Meta Quest and seamlessly continue on XBOX console, PC, or mobile devices with cloud gaming. With cloud saves, your progress stays synced no matter how you play*.\n\n\n*Via the XBOX app, free in the Meta Horizon Store. XBOX Cloud Gaming: Requires supported device and Xbox Game Pass subscription (both sold separately). Game catalog varies (xbox.com/play). Select regions (Xbox.com/regions) and devices (xbox.com/cloud-devices). Terms apply. XBOX Remote Play: Requires Microsoft Account with XBOX profile, supported controller and supportedconsole. Some games and online console multiplayer require XBOX Game Pass subscription. Games, console, controller, and subscription sold separately.\n\n** Eligibility rules and terms apply: www.meta.com/legal/quest/meta-horizon-plus-terms . Streaming limits apply. Select regions. \n  \n\n\n", "short_description": "Stream up to hundreds of games* like Halo Infinite, Forza Motorsport and Starfield on a massive 2D virtual display in Meta Quest with XBOX Game Pass via cloud gaming.\n\n*Via the XBOX app, free in the Meta Horizon Store. XBOX Cloud Gaming: Requires supported device and Xbox Game Pass subscription (both sold separately). Game catalog varies (xbox.com/play). Select regions (Xbox.com/regions) and devices (xbox.com/cloud-devices). Terms apply. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/privacy/privacystatement", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/servicesagreement", "publisher_name": "Microsoft", "support_website_url": "https://www.meta.com/help/quest/articles/in-vr-experiences/oculus-apps/xbox-cloud-gaming/", "website_url": "https://www.xbox.com/play", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "539527055410505"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "RACING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_PE", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es", "en_US"